diff --git a/NOTES.md b/NOTES.md
index e1e7d87..3359768 100644
--- a/NOTES.md
+++ b/NOTES.md
@@ -7,3 +7,9 @@
 - A hidden wall (NOT in obs) runs along x=0 for the full arena length -> rover0 confined to x>0, rover1 to x<0. Rover0 min x at y=-1.75 is 0.23 (so wall half-thickness + rover radius = 0.23).
 - Motions that collide are rejected entirely (rover stays put); the operator in that step still applies.
 - Arena is 5m square (approx -2.5..2.5).
+## Collision (probed)
+- Motion world-frame, exact, clipped. Only end pose checked (no swept). Rotations also collision-checked.
+- Pillars: rover footprint lumpy/heading dependent; safe model: circle r=0.24 vs pillar box (contact range 0.167-0.2375).
+- Mounds: circle r=0.177 vs mound box (half 0.25).
+- Walls (arena edge, middle wall): |x|,|y| <= 2.2729; rover0 x>=0.2271, rover1 x<=-0.2271. No gaps.
+- Lander: safe rule keep rover centre x>=-1.205 or y>=-1.465.
